{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのコメント"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やはり紅白の影響力はすごいんだなぁ、と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの思いを背負って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂オーラ炸裂できるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで本番がんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、舞台「青い瞳」を観に行きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岩松了さん演出の舞台は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「結びの庭」に続いて2作品目。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に脳がぐるぐると使われます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通ではない感情が舞台上で渦巻いていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいものを体感させていただいたな、と思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/11/27/2375834/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前田敦子さんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声も姿もとても魅力的で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お芝居に目が釘付けでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次舞台やるとき教えて！！と言っていただいたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また出れるようにがんばるぞぉー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「リボンの騎士」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京公演は終わってしまいましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ大阪いきますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関西の方はもちろん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中国・四国・九州のみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひぜひ観にきてください(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてリボンロスの東京の方も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったら♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2015/11/27/2375834/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月3～6日までシアターBRAVA！にて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お待ちしてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://www.nelke.co.jp/chanelke/ribbon-no-kishi_digest/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演のダイジェストムービーが公開されました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たら懐かしくて泣けました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ終わってないのに笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またシルバーランドに戻れるの楽しみですっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}